301
00:29:05,040 --> 00:29:05,540
やったー！
Yaaay!

302
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:22,040
背後にわシャッターの壁 指先は鉄の匂い
There's a wall of shutters behind me, my fingertips smell like steel.

303
00:29:24,040 --> 00:29:26,540
進めはじけの道コンデショウ find a way ここから
Move ahead, strum those strings, find a way from here!

304
00:29:26,540 --> 00:29:29,540
found out 見つける rockをかなでろ
You'll find what you're looking for, play some rock,

305
