いつも思うよ いつ寝てるんだろ
I always wonder when am I sleeping

319
00:30:43,848 --> 00:30:46,048
Find a way あたしも
I'll find a way too

320
00:30:46,548 --> 00:30:48,848
Song for 歌うよ
