But you know what? I'll keep playing

329
00:32:02,848 --> 00:32:05,548
今夜もビッグなストーリー
Tonight will also be a big story

330
00:32:07,048 --> 00:32:09,048
Find a way ここから
Find a way out of here

331
00:32:09,248 --> 00:32:11,548
Found out 見つける
We'll find it out

332
00:32:11,848 --> 00:32:14,048
Rockを奏でろ
Rock out!

333
00:32:14,248 --> 00:32:17,048
Luckを歌うよ
I'll sing for luck

334
00:32:17,548 --> 00:32:22,548
いつまでだってここにいるよ
I'll continue to be here

335
00:32:22,848 --> 00:32:28,848
通り過ぎていく人の中に
Where the people pass by

336
00:32:29,048 --> 00:32:32,548
闇にとざされたステージで
On the stage closed off by the darkness

337
00:32:32,848 --> 00:32:36,548
今希望の歌歌うよ
Now I'll sing a song of hope

338
00:32:39,048 --> 00:32:44,548
あなただって疲れてるでしょ その背中にも届けたいよ
You must be tired too, I want this song to reach you

339
00:32:45,048 --> 00:32:54,048
こんな暗闇の中からの 希望照らす光の歌を
From within such a darkness, the song of light shines with hope

340
00:32:55,048 --> 00:33:00,048
その歌を
This very song

341
00:33:43,548 --> 00:33:46,548
もうすぐ時計は6時
It's almost 6 o'clock

342
00:33:46,848 --> 00:33:50,048
もうそこに一番星
And now I see the first star

343
00:33:50,548 --> 00:33:54,848
影を踏んで 夜に紛れたくなる帰り道
On my way back home, I surrender to the night

344
00:33:58,048 --> 00:34:01,548
どんなに探してみても 一つしかない星
No matter what way I look, there's only one star

345
00:34:02,048 --> 00:34:05,548
何億光年 離れたところからあんなに輝く
Shining oh so bright, millions of light-years away

346
00:34:09,548 --> 00:34:12,048
いいな 君はみんなから愛されて
You must be so lucky, loved by everyone

347
00:34:12,548 --> 00:34:15,548
「いいや 僕は ずっと一人きりさ」
"You can't see how lonely, the stars are"

348
00:34:16,048 --> 00:34:21,048
君と集まって星座になれたら
If I could be a constellation with you

349
00:34:21,548 --> 00:34:24,048
星降る夜 一瞬の願い事
On every starry night, bringing every wish to light

350
00:34:24,548 --> 00:34:29,048
きらめいて ゆらめいて 震えているシグナル
Shimmering and gently trembling signals

351
00:34:31,548 --> 00:34:35,548
君と集まって星座になれたら
If I could be a constellation with you

352
00:34:36,048 --> 00:34:39,548
空見上げて 指を差せるような
