376
00:36:54,727 --> 00:37:02,647
君と集まって星座になれたら
If you and I could come together and be a constellation

377
00:37:02,647 --> 00:37:09,357
夜ひろげて 描こう絵空事
Opening up the night, let's draw an idle fantasy

378
00:37:09,357 --> 00:37:16,347
暗闇を照らすような 満月じゃなくても
Even if it's not a full moon illuminating the darkness

379
00:37:16,347 --> 00:37:23,007
だから集まって星座になりたい
That's why I want to come together and be a constellation

380
00:37:23,007 --> 00:37:30,067
いろどりどりの光 放ような
