381
00:37:30,067 --> 00:37:35,367
つないだ線 ほどけないよ
I won't untie the connected line

382
00:37:35,367 --> 00:38:57,536
君がどんなにまぶしくても
No matter how dazzling you are

383
00:38:57,536 --> 00:39:00,726
午前二時 フミキリに 望遠鏡を担いでいた
At 2:00 AM, I carried a telescope to the railroad crossing

384
00:39:00,726 --> 00:39:05,206
ベルトに結んだラジオ 雨は降らないらしい
The radio tied to my belt said it wouldn't rain

385
00:39:05,206 --> 00:39:10,566
二分後に君が来た 大袈裟な荷物背負って来た
Two minutes later, you came, carrying exaggerated luggage

386
00:39:10,566 --> 00:39:16,686
始めようか 天体観測 ほうき星を探して
Shall we begin astronomical observation, searching for a shooting star?

387
00:39:16,686 --> 00:39:22,806
深い闇に呑まれないように 精一杯だった
I tried my hardest not to be swallowed by the deep darkness

388
00:39:22,806 --> 00:39:29,946
君の震える手を 握ろうとした あの日は
On that day when I tried to hold your trembling hand

389
00:39:29,946 --> 00:39:36,806
見えないモノを見ようとて 望遠鏡を覗き込んだ
I looked into the telescope, trying to see the invisible

390
00:39:36,806 --> 00:39:42,556
静寂を切り裂いて いくつも声が生まれたよ
Tearing through the silence, many voices were born

391
00:39:42,556 --> 00:39:49,056
明日が僕らを呼んだって 返事もろくにしなかった
Even when tomorrow called out to us, I barely replied

392
00:39:49,056 --> 00:39:56,606
「イマ」という ほうき星 君と二人追いかけていた
Chasing together with you, a shooting star called "Now"

393
00:40:00,186 --> 00:40:06,496
静寂を切り裂いていくつもの声が生まれたよ
Several voices were born, cutting through the silence.

394
00:40:07,186 --> 00:40:12,846
明日が僕らを呼んだって 返事もろくにしなかった
Even when tomorrow called out to us, we barely bothered to reply.

395
00:40:13,316 --> 00:40:18,576
「イマ」というほうき星 君と二人追いかけていた
We were chasing a comet called "Now", the two of us together.

396
00:40:21,936 --> 00:40:26,746
気が付けばいつでも ひたむき何か探している
Before we knew it, we were always earnestly searching for something.

397
00:40:27,196 --> 00:40:32,546
幸せの定義とか 悲しみの置き場とか
The definition of happiness, where to put our sorrows...

398
00:40:33,066 --> 00:40:38,896
生まれたら死ぬまで ずっと探しているさあ
We keep searching for them from birth until death, so...

399
00:40:39,206 --> 00:40:44,816
始めようか天体観測 ほうき星を探して
Let's begin our astronomical observation, searching for the comet.

400
00:40:45,086 --> 00:40:50,646
今までに見つけたものは 全部覚えている
I remember everything I've found up until now.

401
00:40:51,166 --> 00:40:54,746
君の震える手を 握れなかった痛みも
Even the pain of not being able to hold your trembling hand,

402
00:40:55,166 --> 00:41:01,186
知らないものを知ろうとして 望遠鏡を覗き込んだ
I peered through the telescope, trying to know what I didn't know.

403
00:41:01,616 --> 00:41:07,516
暗闇を照らすような 微かな光探したよ
Searching for a faint light that would illuminate the darkness.

404
00:41:08,166 --> 00:41:13,536
そして知った痛みを 未だに僕は覚えている
And the pain I came to know then, I still remember to this day.

405
00:41:14,066 --> 00:41:19,706
「イマ」というほうき星 今も一人追いかけている
I'm still chasing that comet called "Now" all by myself.

406
00:41:26,106 --> 00:41:32,016
背が伸びるにつれて 伝えたいことも増えていた
As I grew taller, the things I wanted to tell you also increased.

407
00:41:32,486 --> 00:41:39,086
宛のない手紙も 崩れる程重くなった僕は元気でいるよ
Letters with no address became heavy enough to collapse. I'm doing well,

408
00:41:40,106 --> 00:41:43,146
心配事も少ないよ
and I don't have many worries.

409
00:41:43,566 --> 00:41:46,946
ただ一つ 今も思い出すよ
Only one thing I still remember:

410
00:41:49,296 --> 00:41:54,666
予報外れの雨に打たれて 泣き出しそうな
Beaten by unforecasted rain, looking as if you're about to cry,

411
00:41:55,116 --> 00:42:00,736
君の震える手を 握れなかったあの時を
that time when I couldn't hold your trembling hand.

412
00:42:01,136 --> 00:42:06,216
見えてるものを見落として 望遠鏡をまた担いで
Overlooking what is visible, I hoisted the telescope once more,

413
00:42:06,646 --> 00:42:11,916
静寂と闇の帰り道を 駆け抜けた
and ran through the way home of silence and darkness.

414
00:42:12,256 --> 00:42:17,716
そして知った痛みが 未だに僕を支えている
And the pain I came to know then still supports me.

415
00:42:18,126 --> 00:42:23,706
「イマ」というほうき星 今も一人追いかけている
I'm still chasing that comet called "Now" all by myself.

416
00:42:24,096 --> 00:42:29,686
もう一度君に会おうとして 望遠鏡をまた担いで
Trying to meet you once more, I hoisted the telescope again,

417
00:42:30,116 --> 00:42:35,456
前と同じ午前二時 フミキリまで駆けてくよ
