Next is the random rubber strap! This was drawn by the Captain! It features outfits and hairstyles we didn't have last time, so you definitely want this! I worked hard on drawing it, so please be sure to get it!

581
00:57:34,988 --> 00:57:56,608
そしてこれは欲しいでしょ！おでかけマリンぬいぐるみです！顔面はね船長が描かせていただいて監修しました！かわいい顔で届きますように～！ちっちゃいぬいぐるみなのでぜひ持ち運んだり胸の谷間に挟んだり小物入れに入れたりしてください！あ、小物入れ持ってないですか？ならこれはどうですか！？
And you definitely want this! The Outing Marine plushie! The face was drawn and supervised by the Captain! I hope it arrives with a cute face~! Since it's a tiny plushie, please carry it around, tuck it in your cleavage, or put it in an accessory pouch! Oh, you don't have an accessory pouch? Well, how about this!?

